1807
01:16:37,333 --> 01:16:38,900
- This car doesn't
have an airbag.

1808
01:16:38,900 --> 01:16:40,167
I'm very short.

1809
01:16:41,433 --> 01:16:43,700
- What are you doing, Dave?

1810
01:16:49,433 --> 01:16:53,167
- Would you look, do I
have corn in my teeth?

1811
01:16:57,567 --> 01:16:59,967
- At least turn on the radio.

1812
01:17:02,833 --> 01:17:04,900
- Monkey is frantically
looking around for oil pans

1813
01:17:04,900 --> 01:17:06,233
and light bulbs.

1814
01:17:08,233 --> 01:17:10,067
- You do this, and I will
call a legion of Beanie Babies

1815
01:17:10,067 --> 01:17:11,233
down upon you.

1816
01:17:14,733 --> 01:17:19,033
♪ Upon the fields of barley ♪

1817
01:17:19,033 --> 01:17:23,033
♪ Walk in fields of gold ♪

1818
01:17:23,033 --> 01:17:26,300
(suspenseful music)

1819
01:17:26,300 --> 01:17:28,133
- Oh, like you have
such a great kid.

1820
01:17:28,133 --> 01:17:29,133
Get over it!

1821
01:17:34,333 --> 01:17:38,500
- My family does have a
plot if you wouldn't mind.

1822
01:17:43,100 --> 01:17:47,333
- Tell the other monkey
percussionists I love them.

1823
01:17:48,500 --> 01:17:49,667
- That wasn't me.

1824
01:17:49,667 --> 01:17:50,667
You slipped.

1825
01:17:56,833 --> 01:18:00,700
- There are cigar bars
even in the desert!

1826
01:18:00,700 --> 01:18:03,600
(upbeat pop music)

1827
01:18:08,000 --> 01:18:09,533
- You're gonna have to
do better than that,

1828
01:18:09,533 --> 01:18:10,867
you little bastard!

1829
01:18:10,867 --> 01:18:13,933
- Is he yelling at Mason Reese?

1830
01:18:13,933 --> 01:18:16,933
- Let's see you get out of this!

1831
01:18:16,933 --> 01:18:19,367
(thunder crashes)

1832
01:18:19,367 --> 01:18:24,300
- Satan's subcontract with
God to arrange a storm.

1833
01:18:24,300 --> 01:18:28,033
- His hair's made of
wool, it's gonna shrink.

1834
01:18:30,033 --> 01:18:32,867
(thunder crashes)

1835
