I just don't see the appeal.

1844
01:19:17,133 --> 01:19:20,033
- Nah, not doing
it for me, either.

1845
01:19:21,700 --> 01:19:23,067
(David yells)

1846
01:19:23,067 --> 01:19:24,300
(thunder crashes)

1847
01:19:24,300 --> 01:19:25,200
- So, evil wins,
Grandpa Borgnine?

1848
01:19:25,200 --> 01:19:26,433
- That's right.

1849
01:19:26,433 --> 01:19:28,667
Even your tiny soul
is doomed, Billy.

1850
01:19:28,667 --> 01:19:31,500
(thunder crashes)

1851
01:19:32,900 --> 01:19:34,300
- Yeah, I got a crack
this guy can crawl out of.

1852
01:19:34,300 --> 01:19:35,800
(Mike laughs)

1853
01:19:35,800 --> 01:19:36,633
- Wow.

1854
01:19:38,200 --> 01:19:42,600
- I'm stiff and dry and
I have a big, lumpy butt.

1855
01:19:42,600 --> 01:19:44,767
- God help me!

1856
01:19:44,767 --> 01:19:46,033
- Sorry, Unitarian.

1857
01:19:46,033 --> 01:19:47,967
According to you, I'm in
the butterflies and the

1858
