1861
01:19:54,500 --> 01:19:57,233
(David grunts)

1862
01:19:57,233 --> 01:20:00,533
(thunder crashes)

1863
01:20:00,533 --> 01:20:02,100
(David laughs)

1864
01:20:02,100 --> 01:20:04,100
- Ooh, what?

1865
01:20:04,100 --> 01:20:06,500
I hear laughter in the rain.

1866
01:20:06,500 --> 01:20:09,233
(thunder cracks)

1867
01:20:11,600 --> 01:20:12,867
- No Grandpa Borgnine!

1868
01:20:12,867 --> 01:20:14,933
Leave light and
hope for me, please!

1869
01:20:14,933 --> 01:20:16,567
- Get out from behind
that cushion, Billy.

1870
01:20:16,567 --> 01:20:17,733
It gets worse.

1871
