(Servo grunts)

1913
01:22:11,833 --> 01:22:13,167
- Well, look at you.

1914
01:22:13,167 --> 01:22:15,033
What gypsy ring
do you belong to?

1915
01:22:15,033 --> 01:22:15,867
- Piss off.

1916
01:22:15,867 --> 01:22:16,833
- Gypsy ring?

1917
01:22:16,833 --> 01:22:18,033
- Yeah, what's with the costume?

1918
01:22:18,033 --> 01:22:21,000
It's certainly not Halloween.

1919
