(laughter)

1972
01:24:07,333 --> 01:24:08,233
- Grandma!

1973
01:24:08,233 --> 01:24:09,700
- Dad killed the dog!

1974
01:24:09,700 --> 01:24:12,033
- Michael, how are you, darling?

1975
01:24:12,033 --> 01:24:13,633
- Oh damn, wouldn't you know it?

1976
01:24:13,633 --> 01:24:15,300
Mary, there's my phone,
I'll talk to you later.

1977
01:24:15,300 --> 01:24:16,600
- All right, Pete,
thank you so much.

1978
01:24:16,600 --> 01:24:17,433
- Welcome home.

1979
01:24:17,433 --> 01:24:18,400
- Oh, thank you.

1980
01:24:18,400 --> 01:24:19,900
Michael, how are you?

1981
01:24:19,900 --> 01:24:21,467
- Fine, is that for me?

1982
01:24:21,467 --> 01:24:22,400
- That you, Mom?

1983
01:24:22,400 --> 01:24:24,467
- Yes! How was your birthday?

1984
01:24:24,467 --> 01:24:25,767
Did you have a party?

1985
01:24:25,767 --> 01:24:27,500
- Yeah, can I open
my present now?

1986
01:24:27,500 --> 01:24:29,833
- Well, take it over
to the table, and wait

1987
01:24:29,833 --> 01:24:31,433
