1988
01:24:31,433 --> 01:24:32,367
- Okay.

1989
01:24:32,367 --> 01:24:34,500
- Okay, where's the scotch?

1990
01:24:36,967 --> 01:24:38,200
- [David] Mom!

1991
01:24:38,200 --> 01:24:39,033
- Hi!

1992
01:24:39,033 --> 01:24:39,967
Oh, David!

1993
01:24:39,967 --> 01:24:41,000
What has happened to you?

1994
01:24:41,000 --> 01:24:42,267
- Don't even ask, Mom.

1995
01:24:42,267 --> 01:24:43,767
- Have you been in an
accident or something?

1996
01:24:43,767 --> 01:24:45,333
- Look, you wouldn't
believe me if I told you.

1997
01:24:45,333 --> 01:24:46,567
- Can I open my present now?

1998
01:24:46,567 --> 01:24:47,833
Please, Grandma, please!

1999
01:24:47,833 --> 01:24:49,100
- Yes dear, you may.

2000
01:24:49,100 --> 01:24:50,833
David, are you sure
you feel all right?

2001
01:24:50,833 --> 01:24:52,700
- I'm sure, Mom, I'm just fine.

2002
01:24:52,700 --> 01:24:53,633
I'm fine.

2003
01:24:53,633 --> 01:24:54,567
Hey, did you see how well

2004
01:24:54,567 --> 01:24:55,367
I took care of your plants?

2005
01:24:55,367 --> 01:24:56,633
Oh, they look beautiful!

2006
01:24:56,633 --> 01:24:57,700
I can't believe how
much they've grown.

2007
01:24:57,700 --> 01:24:58,800
(David laughs)

2008
01:24:58,800 --> 01:25:00,100
- Dad, look!

2009
01:25:00,100 --> 01:25:01,967
- So you kept the kid, huh?

2010
01:25:01,967 --> 01:25:03,333
- Isn't it darling?

2011
01:25:03,333 --> 01:25:04,467
(intense music)

2012
01:25:04,467 --> 01:25:06,067
- My cabinets are flying away!

2013
01:25:06,067 --> 01:25:08,700
- Michael, go outside!

2014
01:25:08,700 --> 01:25:09,633
- David!

2015
01:25:09,633 --> 01:25:10,500
- Don't ask questions, Mom.

2016
01:25:10,500 --> 01:25:11,633
- What is going on here?

2017
01:25:11,633 --> 01:25:13,033
- I tripped over my bun!

2018
01:25:13,033 --> 01:25:13,867
- David!

2019
01:25:14,733 --> 01:25:16,033
- Mom!

2020
01:25:16,033 --> 01:25:18,833
- Dad, Dad, Dad!

2021
01:25:18,833 --> 01:25:21,000
- Dad has one syllable.

2022
01:25:21,000 --> 01:25:21,833
- Dah-ud.

2023
01:25:25,100 --> 01:25:26,600
- God can't help.

2024
01:25:26,600 --> 01:25:30,733
He's too busy helping Reggie
White win football games.

2025
01:25:30,733 --> 01:25:31,667
- [David] Run faster!

2026
01:25:31,667 --> 01:25:33,233
- Come on Grandpa Borgnine!

2027
01:25:33,233 --> 01:25:36,333
No wonder you never
sold this turkey!

2028
01:25:37,867 --> 01:25:41,067
- Hey, it's what
I do, lighten up.

2029
01:25:41,067 --> 01:25:45,367
- Saint Merlin not recognized
by the Catholic church.

2030
01:25:45,367 --> 01:25:48,133
- Oh, you found it.

2031
01:25:48,133 --> 01:25:49,800
- Oh, my bra popped.

2032
01:25:51,000 --> 01:25:52,767
- Sweetheart, you
can come home now.

2033
01:25:52,767 --> 01:25:54,800
- Ronald McDonald's half sister.

2034
01:25:54,800 --> 01:25:57,667
