back in Merlin's possession,

2035
01:25:57,667 --> 01:26:01,400
Merlin could return
home with renewed hope.

2036
01:26:01,400 --> 01:26:03,000
- For what, Grandpa, come on!

2037
01:26:03,000 --> 01:26:05,367
- Of course, he'd still
have to decide what to do

2038
01:26:05,367 --> 01:26:07,533
with the monkey to
ensure nothing like this

2039
