ever happened again.

2040
01:26:09,800 --> 01:26:12,667
- [Merlin] I'll
deal with you later.

2041
01:26:12,667 --> 01:26:14,933
- Forget it, Grandpa,
start from scratch!

2042
01:26:14,933 --> 01:26:18,333
- But for now, content that
everything was back to normal,

2043
01:26:18,333 --> 01:26:22,333
Merlin could reopen his
shop and continue his quest

2044
01:26:22,333 --> 01:26:26,567
to inspire the hopes and
dreams of all those...

2045
01:26:26,567 --> 01:26:27,933
- With Satanic monkeys.

2046
01:26:27,933 --> 01:26:31,533
- Whose lives would
soon touch his own.

2047
01:26:31,533 --> 01:26:34,500
(Crow mimics snoring)

2048
01:26:34,500 --> 01:26:37,267
- Now, time to die.

2049
01:26:39,933 --> 01:26:42,100
- I also have a script
called Chinatown,

2050
01:26:42,100 --> 01:26:44,433
but I don't like it as much.

2051
01:26:46,633 --> 01:26:49,667
- I'm hooking a
beer, you need one?

2052
01:26:49,667 --> 01:26:51,767
(grunts)

2053
01:26:53,500 --> 01:26:55,100
- My goodness, you've grown big.

2054
01:26:55,100 --> 01:26:57,533
- Since I started that story.

2055
01:27:00,667 --> 01:27:02,800
- Eh, this is sorta clean.

2056
01:27:04,400 --> 01:27:05,467
- Monkey, oh!

2057
01:27:07,000 --> 01:27:07,833
Car coming!

2058
01:27:07,833 --> 01:27:08,833
Flaming cat!

2059
01:27:10,733 --> 01:27:11,567
Dog died!

2060
01:27:12,500 --> 01:27:14,467
Mean psychics, oh grandpa!

2061
01:27:14,467 --> 01:27:16,033
Oh no! (sobs)

2062
01:27:16,033 --> 01:27:17,300
(snores)

2063
01:27:17,300 --> 01:27:18,133
Help me.

2064
01:27:22,433 --> 01:27:25,933
- Here's your contact
